<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Rustroom — third-party licences</title>
<style>
body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 60em; margin: 2em auto; padding: 0 1em; line-height: 1.5; }
pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #f4f4f4; padding: 1em; font-size: 0.85em; }
li { margin: 0.15em 0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Third-party licences</h1>
<p>Rustroom is free software under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or later (<code>LICENSE.txt</code>).
It is built from the Rust crates below, each under the licence shown, and from the native libraries and fonts whose
licences are in the <code>licenses</code> folder beside this file (LibRaw, libheif, libde265, LittleCMS, LensFun's
database, Inter, Phosphor).</p>
<h2>Overview</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}<li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}</ul>
<h2>Licences</h2>
{{#each licenses}}
<h3 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h3>
<p>Used by:</p>
<ul>
{{#each used_by}}<li>{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</li>
{{/each}}</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
